<title>UK: Hyder prices 75 mln stg Aug 2016 bond.</title>
<headline>Hyder prices 75 mln stg Aug 2016 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond increase, announced earlier by lead manager NatWest Capital Markets has now been priced.  The bond has been increased to 200 million stg from 125 million stg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYDER PLC</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN STG   COUPON     9.50	MATURITY    19.AUG.16</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  109.113   PAY DATE   *04.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    109.113   SPREAD	+85 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	BAA1	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRITAIN   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT GILT DUE 2015</p>
<p> NOTES	*PLUS 195 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>		FUNGIBLE WITH OUTSTANDING 125 MLN 40 DAYS AFTER PAY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
